  "title": "North Lake Union",
  "indexDescription": "Photos of Lake Union",
  "description": "Kathleen and I have walked around Lake Union several times. \n\nThe Cheshiahud Lake Union Loop is a 6.4 mile urban trail that loops Lake Union. \n\nThis collection is just part of the lake, mostly the north, with one west and one south. \n\nIt’s a nice mix of industry, trails and parks. ",
